        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adèle King, Chloë Agnew\n- Roles: entertainer, singer, songwriter\n- Groups: Maxi, Dick and Twink, Celtic Woman\n- Places: Ireland, Dublin\n\nFacts:\n- Adèle King was born Adèle Condron-King on 4 April 1951 and is an Irish entertainer.\n- In the late 1960s and 1970s, Adèle King was known as Twink as a member of Maxi, Dick and Twink, a girl band in Ireland.\n- Chloë Alexandra Adele Emily Agnew was born on 9 June 1989 in Dublin, Ireland.\n- Chloë Agnew is an Irish singer and songwriter.\n- Chloë Agnew was an original former member of the Celtic music group Celtic Woman and was its youngest member.\n- Adèle King is the mother of singer Chloë Agnew from Celtic Woman.",
